abstract: >
  Pin-and-execute lab for OWASP LLM 2025 and Agentic 2026 rows. Each row
  pins a CVE, an AIID, or a dated N/A, then runs a fixture oracle.
  Classification matrices are prior art. Demonstrated stays zero until
  external primary evidence earns that word.
keywords:
